<section id="bp-how" data-scroll-story>
  <div class="hw-wrap lp-wrap">
    <div class="hw-head"><p class="hw-eyebrow">Comment ça marche ?</p><h2 class="hw-title">Ton design prend vie en <span class="os-accent">trois étapes.</span></h2></div>
