      </details>
      <details class="reason" data-video="{{ 'bp-reason-3.mp4' | asset_url }}">
        <summary class="reason-head">
          <div class="reason-img"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 40" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="1.5" y="1.5" width="45" height="37" rx="5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"/><circle cx="14" cy="13" r="3.5" fill="currentColor"/><path d="M5 33 L18 20 L27 28 L35 20 L44 29" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div>
          <div class="reason-titles"><span class="reason-badge">Raison 3</span><h3 class="reason-name">C'est apaisant (tu rentres dans ta bulle)</h3></div>
          <span class="reason-chevron" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>
        </summary>
        <div class="reason-body"><div class="reason-media"><video data-src="{{ 'bp-reason-3.mp4' | asset_url }}" autoplay loop muted playsinline preload="none" aria-label="Tri des couleurs et placement des Pops, geste répétitif et apaisant"></video></div><p>Choisir les couleurs, trier, placer les Pops une à une… c'est doux, répétitif, relaxant. Parfait pour décompresser.</p></div>
      </details>
      <details class="reason" data-video="{{ 'bp-reason-4.mp4' | asset_url }}">
        <summary class="reason-head">
          <div class="reason-img"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 40" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="1.5" y="1.5" width="45" height="37" rx="5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"/><circle cx="14" cy="13" r="3.5" fill="currentColor"/><path d="M5 33 L18 20 L27 28 L35 20 L44 29" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div>
